{"id":"n42399-1-7","stage":5,"title":"단일 · 单一","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42399-1-7-1","ko":"이곳에 자동차 공장이 세워진다고요?","zh":"这里要建汽车工厂吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳에","audio":"/audio/3caba3fe9489dff29af4.mp3"}},{"text":"자동차","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}},{"text":"공장이","meaning":"厂，工厂","explanation":"공장：厂，工厂；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공장","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62411","senseId":"1","lemma":"공장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공장이","audio":"/audio/d423a6d67833b6aba65a.mp3"}},{"text":"세워진다고요?","meaning":"建，建立；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"세우다：建，建立；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄴ다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"13","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세워진다고요","audio":"/audio/699db77d1b7eb3930180.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"19d82475f0166d70","term":"공장","zh":"厂，工厂","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3","entryId":"62411","definition":"加工原料或材料制造物品的地方。","pronunciation":["공장"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"建，建立","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"造房子或设施。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/31819bd8542d97460046.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42399-1-7-2","ko":"네, 단일 공장으로는 세계 최대 규모가 될 겁니다.","zh":"是的，这将会是单座工厂规模上全球最大的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"단일","meaning":"单一","explanation":"단일：单一。","readings":[{"term":"단일","audio":"/audio/00c86348f5f192ea908b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42399","senseId":"1","lemma":"단일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단일","audio":"/audio/00c86348f5f192ea908b.mp3"}},{"text":"공장으로는","meaning":"厂，工厂","explanation":"공장：厂，工厂；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공장","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62411","senseId":"1","lemma":"공장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공장으로는","audio":"/audio/faac39a1ec3bc38b2df4.mp3"}},{"text":"세계","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界。","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}},{"text":"최대","meaning":"最大","explanation":"최대：最大。","readings":[{"term":"최대","audio":"/audio/ee3b70e7b026e0a74b3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62484","senseId":"1","lemma":"최대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최대","audio":"/audio/ee3b70e7b026e0a74b3a.mp3"}},{"text":"규모가","meaning":"规模","explanation":"규모：规模；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"규모","audio":"/audio/c238359b8033a59e4feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37054","senseId":"1","lemma":"규모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"규모가","audio":"/audio/7ae10c9eeae5662b41f8.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"겁니다.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겁니다","audio":"/audio/86254b469958c26e53f4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"00c86348f5f192ea","term":"단일","zh":"单一","audio":"/audio/00c86348f5f192ea908b.mp3","entryId":"42399","definition":"不是有多个，而是一个。","pronunciation":["다닐"]},{"id":"19d82475f0166d70","term":"공장","zh":"厂，工厂","audio":"/audio/19d82475f0166d702ebe.mp3","entryId":"62411","definition":"加工原料或材料制造物品的地方。","pronunciation":["공장"]},{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"地球上的所有国家。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"id":"ee3b70e7b026e0a7","term":"최대","zh":"最大","audio":"/audio/ee3b70e7b026e0a74b3a.mp3","entryId":"62484","definition":"数、量、大小等最大。","pronunciation":["최ː대","췌ː대"]},{"id":"c238359b8033a59e","term":"규모","zh":"规模","audio":"/audio/c238359b8033a59e4feb.mp3","entryId":"37054","definition":"东西或现象的大小或范围。","pronunciation":["규모"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4992995c54fb4b2e2573.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42399","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3497,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，这将会是单座工厂规模上全球最大的。","楼上怎么总是这么吵？","这里要建汽车工厂吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，这将会是单座工厂规模上全球最大的。","这里要建汽车工厂吗？","楼上怎么总是这么吵？"],"answer":0}]}
